{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  DropPilot — UK Dropshipping SaaS landing page (Shopify section)
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  HOW TO INSTALL (one file, no dependencies except Google Fonts):
  1. In Shopify admin: Online Store > Themes > ... > Edit code
  2. Under "Sections", click "Add a new section"
  3. Name it: droppilot-landing  (Shopify creates droppilot-landing.liquid)
  4. Delete the default content, paste THIS ENTIRE FILE, Save.
  5. Online Store > Themes > Customize > Add section > "DropPilot Landing"
     (works best on a blank/custom page template)
  NOTE: all CSS is scoped under .dp-root so it won't affect your theme.
  ============================================================
{% endcomment %}

